# Feature: PR Metadata Verification, Reformatter Semantics Coverage, and E2E Documentation

## Description
Complete the final three requirements from the master prompt: (1) add a `pr_metadata_verification` E2E conformance test that uses `e2e_mock_gh_logging_script()` to capture and assert all required PR creation flags and body content through a real `ralph auto` run; (2) add reformatter fallback boundary tests covering `BackendCommandFailed` (non-zero exit, no reformatter) and empty-output retry-then-reformatter semantics; (3) create `docs/validate-e2e.md` with the five required sections (architecture overview, test-to-requirement mapping, running instructions, troubleshooting, adding-new-tests template).

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] `pr_metadata_verification` test exists in `src/validate/tests_e2e_conformance.rs`, uses `e2e_mock_gh_logging_script()` to capture full `gh pr create` invocation through the orchestration pipeline
- [ ] PR metadata test asserts `--title` value begins with `ralph:` prefix
- [ ] PR metadata test asserts `--body-file` content contains `Closes #<N>` (issue number), a diff stat section, and a project reference
- [ ] PR metadata test asserts `--head` and `--repo` flags are present in captured args
- [ ] `backend_command_failed_no_reformatter` test exists: mock backend exits non-zero, asserts `BackendCommandFailed` error is surfaced, asserts no reformatter fallback is triggered, asserts task ends `failed`
- [ ] `empty_output_retries_then_reformatter` test exists: mock backend returns empty output, asserts same-backend retry occurs first, then reformatter fallback is attempted
- [ ] Existing `backend_timeout_exhausted_fails_task` already covers timeout → no reformatter; no duplication needed
- [ ] All new tests registered in the `tests()` function of `tests_e2e_conformance.rs` and wired via `mod.rs`
- [ ] `docs/validate-e2e.md` exists with exactly five sections: (1) Architecture overview, (2) Test-to-requirement mapping, (3) Running instructions, (4) Troubleshooting, (5) Adding-new-tests template
- [ ] Documentation test-to-requirement mapping covers all tests from loops 1-3 mapped to master prompt normative rules
- [ ] All existing tests continue to pass (`cargo test` and `ralph validate` green)

## Files to Modify/Create
- `src/validate/tests_e2e_conformance.rs` — Add `pr_metadata_verification`, `backend_command_failed_no_reformatter`, and `empty_output_retries_then_reformatter` tests; register in `tests()` vec
- `src/validate/mock_scripts.rs` — Add helper scripts: `nonzero_exit_backend_script()` (backend that exits non-zero after consuming input), `empty_output_backend_script()` (backend that produces no output); potentially add `e2e_mock_gh_with_env_logging()` variant if the existing `e2e_mock_gh_logging_script()` needs environment wiring for the orchestration integration path
- `src/validate/harness.rs` — Add any needed helpers for configuring reformatter backend settings or capturing reformatter invocation logs if not already available
- `docs/validate-e2e.md` — New file with all five required documentation sections

## Dependencies
- Requires: Backend Timeout Conformance and Mock Script Foundations (loop 1), QA/Review Rollback Failure Semantics and Impl-Response Artifact Conformance (loop 2)
- Blocks: none (final feature; completes all master prompt requirements)


