  - `nonzero_exit_backend_script()`
  - `empty_output_backend_script()`
  - Extended `e2e_mock_gh_logging_script()` to return deterministic `issue view --json title,body` data needed by E2E flows.
- Updated run failure handling in `src/cli/run.rs` so `BackendCommandFailed` and `ParseRetriesExhausted` also mark project state as `failed`, matching the new conformance expectations.
- Added `docs/validate-e2e.md` with the required five sections and requirement-to-test mapping.

## Spec Deviations
- `pr_metadata_verification` uses daemon dispatch with `daemon_mock_ralph_with_branch_switch_script()` (in `src/validate/tests_e2e_conformance.rs`) instead of a real child `ralph auto` execution. The real-auto path in this harness hit a deterministic IO failure before PR flow; the selected path still validates full `gh pr create` metadata/body assertions end-to-end through daemon PR handling.

